	(text "V2d USB charger (BQ25886, standalone 2S boost)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 22.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.0 2.0)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d5b1b276-304e-54ed-b29d-eab33bf8c82e")
	)
	(text "Input = J12 FC USB VBUS, 5 V only. CC1/CC2 have 5.1k Rd on the root sheet, so a USB-PD source never offers more than 5 V.\nVBUS operating 4.3 to 6.2 V, OVP 6.2 V, abs max 20 V. VINDPM 4.3 V backs the charger off on a weak port.\nIINDPM = KILIM / RILIM = 1110 / 820 = 1.35 A (Type-C 1.5 A level). ICHG = 3.9k / 3810 = 1.02 A.\nVBUS = (4.3, 5.0, 6.2) V @ (0, 1.2, 1.35) A. CHG_BAT = (6.0, 7.4, 8.2) V @ (0, 0.7, 1.02) A."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 27.94 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "99c13dba-8854-5c21-af47-f15c0228eaed")
	)
	(text "D+ tied to D-: BC1.2 detects a DCP (3 A), so ILIM governs.\nThe FC USB data lines on J12 never reach this IC."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 83.82 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "22467531-973d-5aba-87fa-441a12b5b035")
	)
	(text "OTG and ~{CE} hard tied to GND.\nOTG high would boost the battery back\nout of VBUS: never leave it floating."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 96.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d78c844b-fccc-5e59-8590-790fc77b3604")
	)
	(text "VSET: 0 Ohm = 8.2 V (4.1 V/cell, chosen for\nmargin with no cell balancing).\nDNP R203 (> 150k) = 8.4 V. Never fit 75k or 39k\n(8.7 V / 8.8 V would overcharge Molicel cells)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 127 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "98938edd-449f-546b-8328-d191240c39da")
	)
	(text "TS: fixed 10k/12k divider = 54.5 % of REGN, inside the\n45 C (44.75 %) to 10 C (68.25 %) normal window.\nNo cell thermistor reaches this board. IC thermal\nshutdown and the 12 h safety timer still apply."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 198.12 128.27 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e9d1d384-0ec2-57db-87a2-99d9a74fb06a")
	)
	(text "Battery tap safety"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 198.12 86.36 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a9731664-9907-5faf-b716-767bf56ba0d6")
	)
	(text "Dir_Chrg_In is the raw pack + (upstream of every\npositive inhibit). Charge current returns through\nFC GND and the ground-side inhibit, as with J2.\nF201 opens on a charger or cap short.\nJ203 CHG LINK: fit for bench charging; REMOVE FOR\nFLIGHT so no charger part hangs on the pack.\nBattery-only drain with link fitted: 14 uA typ.\nATP: link out, Dir_Chrg_In to GND leakage < 1 uA.\nATP: 5 V in, 7.4 V load, PG green, STAT red, 1 A."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 198.12 90.17 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "487e3f1d-b3e8-5a99-a0eb-89c4a25bb05a")
	)
	(text "Status LEDs (outer side): green = USB 5 V present;\nred on = charging, off = done, 1 Hz blink = fault."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 198.12 148.59 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ae0cc7af-11a8-5064-88f9-152003afe326")
	)
	(text "SWD pass-through"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 144.78 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.0 2.0)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9cd236a3-ad1f-59f0-ae80-a5bb38fc0665")
	)
	(text "FC J22 is unreachable on an assembled cube. A 1:1 JST-SH 3-pin cable (pin 1 to pin 1)\nruns from FC J22 to J201 on the inner side; J202 on the outer side takes the Raspberry Pi\nDebug Probe cable. Pinout matches FC J22: 1 SWCLK, 2 GND, 3 SWDIO. No parts in series."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 172.72 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ac8d34d2-ab16-504e-a93e-ebd21e954e47")
	)
	(embedded_fonts no)
)
